              ("text",
               (Text
                  "I think effects were part of the multicore effort because they allow userland to define schedulers (with effects you can do lightweight fibers). The OCaml core team does not want to provide and maintain a work stealing, multi threaded scheduler. Effects are a way to delegate that to the ecosystem."))
              ]))
